Mission302Desc=Even when the world appears over, there is always a glimmer of hope, and that hope can be found in the good will of others.  Restore the health of another player, or stop their bleeding using a Bandage DX.\n\nSpread the hope of salvation by using a Bandage DX on a survivor in need.
